Dear Hiring Team,

It is with great pleasure that I submit my candidacy for the *Software Engineer* position with *Kikoff*. I bring more than three years of professional software engineering experience, a Master of Science in Computer Science from Pace University, and hands-on experience delivering customer-facing ReactJS products and reliable AWS-backed services. Kikoff's opportunity to build early stage products that help millions of people move forward financially is a direct match for the kind of visible, meaningful product ownership I seek.

At Sperse, I owned a customer-facing *ReactJS* and TypeScript workflow product end to end, combining visual composition with durable Temporal execution so more than 10,000 users could create, run, and monitor agentic workflows. I also built Python and FastAPI backend services that route requests across 40+ specialized agents and expose 160+ validated actions through REST APIs. To keep that product dependable as it scaled, I strengthened cloud infrastructure and release craftsmanship with GitHub Actions CI/CD, trace-based evaluations, and automated latency, accuracy, and safety gates. This experience prepares me to contribute across Kikoff's ReactJS frontend, backend services, and AWS infrastructure while moving quickly without compromising customer trust.

Previously at Qualitest, I designed a cloud-agnostic Java and Spring Boot storage service spanning AWS S3, Google Cloud Storage, and MinIO, then orchestrated more than 100,000 weekly executions with AWS Step Functions and Lambda to improve error recovery and production reliability. I also built interactive ReactJS data experiences backed by optimized PostgreSQL queries. Across both roles, I have translated customer and stakeholder needs into maintainable production systems through extreme ownership, clear communication, and a strong sense of craftsmanship—the same habits reflected in Kikoff's *Customer Obsessed* and *Act Like an Owner* values.

Kikoff's mission to empower everyone to achieve financial security through radically affordable, accessible technology is compelling to me because it ties engineering quality directly to real customer outcomes. I would welcome the opportunity to help Kikoff build fair, effective, and simple financial pathways at scale. I can be reached at #ph or #eml. Thank you for your time and consideration; I look forward to connecting.

